+$$
+ T_{i,j}^{\tau}:\mathscr E_j^\tau\to\mathscr E_i^\tau,
+ \quad u^\bullet\mapsto(T_{i,j}u)^\bullet,\quad\tau\mapsto\tau.    \tag{32}
+$$
